message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "acc: Anticlustering-Clustering for focused experiments on large populations"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype of a multi-phase experimental design for very large
  populations: representative splitting via anticlustering, adaptive
  exploration balancing representativeness and coverage (tempered density),
  and focusing on a data-driven region with inference on fresh units only.
type: software
